d}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T19:24:57Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T20:55:28Z","body":"There is something weird going on with the CI. It failed with the same error on the master branch today:\r\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"640\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed761f48-65ac-4398-b547-3e278951f805\" />\r\n\r\nmaster: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/23913495607/job/69741396090\r\nthis PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/23914754219/job/69745750273?pr=118120\r\n\r\nUPD: updated with the CI fix from the master","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4180007165/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184713992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118120#issuecomment-4184713992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118120","id":4184713992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75basI","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T18:43:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T19:11:10Z","body":"> There is some duplicate entry here and collapsing affects both\r\n\r\nI could fix it by storing a string = fullpath_cache + categories.size() (or the index, it doesn't matter) BUT there is a bug that's not from this PR - you cannot select the correct item if its inside the duplicate category:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/229ed25f-5f6a-4c16-b390-d5861fd90ed3\r\n\r\nThe problem stems from the way a canvas timestamp is added without an index unlike a viewport timestamp.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/romgerman/godot/blob/49e4f9a9e8bc4999b90b91184f7757e579ed197a/servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp#L496\r\n\r\nIt can be fixed by moving the timestamp call from the `RendererCanvasCull::render_canvas` to the `RendererViewport::_draw_viewport` method and adding an index or some kind of a key to the timestamp path like the viewport timestamp call.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/romgerman/godot/blob/49e4f9a9e8bc4999b90b91184f7757e579ed197a/servers/rendering/renderer_viewport.cpp#L705\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/romgerman/godot/blob/49e4f9a9e8bc4999b90b91184f7757e579ed197a/servers/rendering/renderer_viewport.cpp#L858\r\n\r\nBut I'm not knowledgeable enough about why it is this way in the first place.\r\n\r\nSo the question is - do we accommodate for the duplicated names (which are confusing to the user) or do we fix the names and keep this PR simple?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184713992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184896160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118120#issuecomment-4184896160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118120","id":4184896160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75cHKg","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T19:33:27Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T19:33:27Z","body":"I think it's better to fix the duplicate names. No idea why it's like that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184896160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},